1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,864
Imagine this situation... it happens to thousands of middle-class families in India every single day.

2
00:00:06,864 --> 00:00:10,701
You pay thirty-five thousand rupees every year for health insurance.

3
00:00:10,701 --> 00:00:14,308
You renew it on time for five or six straight years.

4
00:00:14,308 --> 00:00:16,607
You never miss a single payment.

5
00:00:16,607 --> 00:00:18,868
Then, an emergency hits.

6
00:00:18,868 --> 00:00:21,485
Your loved one is admitted to the hospital.

7
00:00:21,485 --> 00:00:26,423
Three days later, you are standing at the hospital billing counter at nine o'clock at night.

8
00:00:26,423 --> 00:00:28,242
The discharge papers are ready.

9
00:00:28,242 --> 00:00:31,495
Your bill is four point five lakh rupees.

10
00:00:31,495 --> 00:00:42,143
And the desk clerk looks up at you and hands you a printed letter saying, Sorry sir, your cashless claim was rejected by the T-P-A due to non-disclosure of a pre-existing disease.

11
00:00:43,767 --> 00:00:45,180
Your heart drops.

12
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,771
Your family panics.

13
00:00:46,771 --> 00:00:58,544
It's night time, the banks are closed, and you are forced to break your fixed deposits, borrow from relatives, or swipe an emergency credit card just to get your loved one out of the hospital.

14
00:00:58,544 --> 00:01:03,461
And you wonder, why did I pay insurance all these years if they abandon me the moment I need them?

15
00:01:04,912 --> 00:01:16,830
What your insurance agent never told you... is that under official regulations in India, there is a legal rule that makes this exact denial illegal, once your policy has crossed five years.

16
00:01:16,830 --> 00:01:19,179
Welcome to Be Practical with Kishore.

17
00:01:19,179 --> 00:01:24,602
In this video, we are not going to shout, and we are not going to promote any insurance policies.

18
00:01:24,602 --> 00:01:33,668
Today, let's look at the real I-R-D-A-I rules, see who really says no, and learn the step-by-step way to get your money back.

19
00:01:33,668 --> 00:01:36,836
Let's break it down... in plain, simple English.

